            "review_text": "Luvleggs\nSeattle, Washington32 contributions\n0\nMore please\nJan 2017 • Couples\nEveryone else was right. You don't choose, but what you get is the best banh xeo I've had in years. Though the atmosphere is almost as fun as the food. A couple noticed we weren't getting our order taken and went off to make sure we were taken care of. You pay for what you eat which is perfect for me, I'm full, I'm done...great prices...floor is like an ice skating rink which just added to the fun for me.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 23, 2017",
