            "review_title": "Review at Banh Xeo Lipton",
            "review_text": "TheodoreDee\n81 contributions\n0\nYummy food and wonderful staff\nAug 2016 • Couples\nThe title says it all. My girlfriend and I were heading to Banh Xeo Ba Duong on a Sat evening but it was too full so we ended up at Banh Xeo Lipton instead. We ordered the Banh Xeo (40,000VND) and Nem (50,000VND). The Banh Xeo wasn't as oily or greasy like at other places but a couple of my Nem's were a bit more pink than I would like. My stomach gave me no issues the next day so it was cooked all the way through. But my favorite part is the staff. So friendly and attentive. It was like heading to your family's house for dinner.\nRead more\nWritten August 8, 2016",
